---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Interactive research lab — Jonas El Gammal" description="Interactive, browser-based explainers for scientific machine learning, primordial signals, and astrophysical populations.">
<header class="page-head"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">Interactive research</span><h1>The lab</h1><p>Small, inspectable demonstrations of the methods behind the papers and software. Change assumptions, follow the intermediate quantities, and see how each model produces its observable result.</p></div></header>
<section class="shell labs"><a href="/lab/gpry/"><span>01 · Scientific ML</span><h2>Watch a surrogate learn</h2><p>Replay a Gaussian-process active-learning run and inspect how uncertainty guides expensive evaluations.</p><b>Open GPry lab →</b></a><a href="/lab/sigway/"><span>02 · Early universe</span><h2>Paint a primordial spectrum</h2><p>Draw a curvature spectrum and calculate the induced gravitational-wave response with SIGWAY kernels, up to 100 bins.</p><b>Open SIGWAY lab →</b></a><a href="/lab/fastropop/"><span>03 · PTA populations</span><h2>Build a binary population</h2><p>Change the cosmic black-hole-binary population and see its source distribution and nanohertz signal respond.</p><b>Open fastropop lab →</b></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.labs{display:grid;gap:1px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding-top:2.5rem}.labs a{background:var(--night);color:var(--cream);min-height:300px;padding:clamp(1.6rem,3.5vw,3rem);text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s}.labs a:hover{background:var(--night-soft)}.labs span,.labs b{color:var(--signal-soft);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;text-transform:uppercase}.labs h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.65rem,2.5vw,2.5rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1}.labs p{color:rgba(244,241,234,.62);font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:500px}.labs b{display:block;margin-top:2rem}@media(max-width:900px){.labs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.labs a{min-height:240px}}</style>
